    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "He Jing: Why did you go watch a movie with him? I’m the one who’s your boyfriend."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "丽丽：因为你很忙，没有时间和我看电影啊。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：因為你很忙，沒有時間和我看電影啊。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì yīn wèi nǐ hěn máng méi yǒu shí jiān hé wǒ kàn diàn yǐng a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Because you’re so busy. You don’t have time to watch a movie with me."
    }
